      *************************************************************             
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING DFHCOMMAREA.                                    
      *************************************************************             
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO.                                                 

           IF NOT ERROR-GRAVE                                                   
              PERFORM 2000-PROCESO                                              
           END-IF.                                                              

           PERFORM 10000-FIN.                                                   
      ********************************************************                  
       1000-INICIO.                                                             
      ********************************************************                  
      * INICIALIZAR VARIABLES                                                   
      ********************************************************                  
           INITIALIZE WS-INDICES.                                               
           INITIALIZE WS-VARIABLES.                                             

           MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-FECHA-SIS.                          

           SET NO-ERROR     TO TRUE                                             
           SET NO-ROLLBACK  TO TRUE                                             
            .                                                                   

      ***************************************************************           
       2000-PROCESO.                                                            
      ***************************************************************           

           PERFORM 2100-OBTENER-NUMERO-REGISTROS                                


      ** CONTROLAMOS QUE EXITAN CABEZAS PARA LAS POLIZAS                        
           IF WS-NUMREG NOT EQUAL ZEROES                                        

              COMPUTE WS-RTO-INT-CAPITAL =                                      
              FUNCTION NUMVAL (X372N005-INTEGRO) / WS-NUMREG                    
              COMPUTE WS-RTO-INT-CAPITAL =                                      
                      WS-RTO-INT-CAPITAL / 100                                  
              COMPUTE WS-REDUCC-PRIMAS =                                        
              FUNCTION NUMVAL (X372N005-RETENI24) / WS-NUMREG                   
              COMPUTE WS-REDUCC-PRIMAS   =                                      
                      WS-REDUCC-PRIMAS   / 100                                  
              COMPUTE WS-REDUCC-TRANCAP =                                       
              FUNCTION NUMVAL (X372N005-RETRENTAN) / WS-NUMREG                  
              COMPUTE WS-REDUCC-TRANCAP  =                                      
                      WS-REDUCC-TRANCAP  / 100                                  

           ELSE                                                                 

              SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                           
              MOVE '07'                TO X372N005-CRETORNO-S                   
              MOVE 'NO EXISTEN POLIZAS CON LOS CRITERIOS SELECCIONADOS'         
                TO X372N005-GERROR-S                                            
              MOVE WS-B372N005         TO X372N005-GNOMPROG-S                   
              MOVE WS-RAMO             TO X372N005-RAMO-S                       
              MOVE WS-POLIZA           TO X372N005-POLIZA-S                     

           END-IF                                                               

           IF NO-ERROR                                                          

              MOVE 1 TO I                                                       

              PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > WS-NUMREG                 

                  INITIALIZE WS-X372M001                                        
                      REPLACING ALPHANUMERIC DATA BY SPACES                     
                                     NUMERIC DATA BY ZEROS                      

                  PERFORM 2200-MOVER-CAMPOS-TABLA                               


                  MOVE 'M6'     TO X372M001-OPERACION-E                         
                  MOVE WS-ANIO(I)                                               
                                TO X372M001-ANIO-E                              
                  MOVE WS-KEXPEDIENTE(I)                                        
                               TO X372M001-KEXPEDIENTE-E                        

                  CALL WS-B372M001 USING WS-X372M001                            

                  IF X372M001-CRETORNO-S NOT = LT-RETURN-OK                     
                     SET ERROR-GRAVE      TO TRUE                               
                     SET NO-ROLLBACK      TO TRUE                               
                  END-IF                                                        

                  MOVE X372M001-CRETORNO-S     TO X372N005-CRETORNO-S           
                  MOVE X372M001-GNOMPROG-S     TO X372N005-GNOMPROG-S           
                  MOVE X372M001-GERROR-S       TO X372N005-GERROR-S             
              END-PERFORM                                                       

           END-IF                                                               

           CONTINUE.                                                            

      ***************************************************************           
       2100-OBTENER-NUMERO-REGISTROS.                                           
      ***************************************************************           
           INITIALIZE WS-X372M004                                               
               REPLACING ALPHANUMERIC DATA BY SPACES                            
                              NUMERIC DATA BY ZEROS                             

      * MOVEMOS EL CAMPO POLIZA DE LA COPY X372N005 A LAS VARIABLES AUX         
           INITIALIZE WS-POLIZA-AUX                                             
           MOVE X372N005-POLIZA(4:7)  TO WS-POLI-AUX                            
           MOVE WS-POLIZA-AUX         TO WS-POLIZA                              
           MOVE '0000'                TO WS-SUBPOL                              
           MOVE 0                     TO WS-CERTIF                              
      *D*                                                                       
      *    DISPLAY ' ENTRAD ' X372N005-POLIZA                                   
      *    DISPLAY ' POLIZA ' WS-POLIZA                                         
      *                       WS-SUBPOL                                         
      *                       WS-CERTIF                                         
      *F*                                                                       


           MOVE 'LP'                  TO X372M004-OPERACION-E                   
           MOVE WS-POLIZA             TO X372M004-KPOLIZA-E                     
           MOVE WS-SUBPOL             TO X372M004-NSUBPOLIZA-E                  
           MOVE WS-CERTIF             TO X372M004-KCERTIFICADO-E                

           MOVE 0 TO XN-J                                                       

           PERFORM UNTIL X372M004-SPAGINACION-S = 'N' OR ERROR-GRAVE            


              CALL WS-B372M004  USING WS-X372M004                               

              MOVE 1 TO XN-I                                                    
      * COMPROBAREMOS CUANTAS CABEZAS TIENE LA POLIZA, EL CONTADOR XN-I         
      * CONTROLA LOS EXPEDIENTES ENCONTRADOS MIENTRAS QUE XN-J CONTROLA         
      * LOS EXPEDIENTES QUE ADEMAS TIENEN EL RAMO IGUAL, QUE NO PUEDE           
      * EXCEDER DE DOS POR POLIZA.                                              

              PERFORM UNTIL XN-I > X372M004-NUM-REGISTROS-S OR                  
                            XN-I > 5 OR                                         
                            ERROR-GRAVE                                         

      * CONTROLAMOS LA PAGINACION                                               
                 IF X372M004-SPAGINACION-S = 'S'                                
                    MOVE X372M004-ANIO-S          (XN-I)                        
                      TO X372M004-ANT-ANIO-E                                    
                    MOVE X372M004-KEXPEDIENTE-S   (XN-I)                        
                      TO X372M004-ANT-KEXPEDIENTE-E                             
                 END-IF                                                         
      * CONTROLAMOS LA POLIZA A ACTUALIZAR                                      
      *          IF X372M004-KRAMO-S(XN-I)        EQUAL WS-RAMO AND             
                 IF X372M004-KPOLIZA-S(XN-I)      EQUAL WS-POLIZA               
      *             X372M004-NSUBPOLIZA-S(XN-I)   EQUAL WS-SUBPOL AND           
      *             X372M004-KCERTIFICADO-S(XN-I) EQUAL WS-CERTIF               

                    ADD 1 TO XN-J                                               
      * MOVEMOS LOS CAMPOS A LAS VARIABLES AUXILIARES                           
                    MOVE X372M004-ANIO-S(XN-I)         TO WS-ANIO(XN-J)         
                    MOVE X372M004-KEXPEDIENTE-S(XN-I)                           
                      TO WS-KEXPEDIENTE(XN-J)                                   
                    MOVE X372M004-IMPCAPITAL-S(XN-I)                            
                      TO WS-CAPITAL(XN-J)                                       
                    MOVE X372M004-IMPBENEFICIOS-S(XN-I)                         
                      TO WS-BENEFICIOS(XN-J)                                    
                    MOVE X372M004-IMPANTICIPO-S(XN-I)                           
                      TO WS-ANTICIPOS(XN-J)                                     
                    MOVE X372M004-IMPINTEPEND-S(XN-I)                           
                      TO WS-INTPENDIENTES(XN-J)                                 
                    MOVE X372M004-KPERSONA1-S(XN-I)                             
                      TO WS-KPERSONA(XN-J)                                      

                  END-IF                                                        

                  ADD 1 TO XN-I                                                 

               END-PERFORM                                                      

      ** CONTROLAMOS QUE NO TENGAN MAS DE DOS CABEZA POR POLIZA                 
              MOVE XN-J                     TO WS-NUMREG                        
      *D*                                                                       
      *       DISPLAY ' NUMERO ' WS-NUMREG                                      
      *F*                                                                       

              IF XN-J > 2                                                       

                 SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                        
                 SET SI-ROLLBACK TO TRUE                                        
                 MOVE 'N'                 TO X372M004-SPAGINACION-S             
                 MOVE '06'                TO X372N005-CRETORNO-S                
                 MOVE 'EXCEDIDO EL NUMERO MAXIMO DE CABEZA PARA LA POLIZ        
      -               'A'                                                       
                   TO X372N005-GERROR-S                                         
                 MOVE WS-B372N005         TO X372N005-GNOMPROG-S                
                 MOVE WS-RAMO             TO X372N005-RAMO-S                    
                 MOVE WS-POLIZA           TO X372N005-POLIZA-S                  

              END-IF                                                            

           END-PERFORM                                                          

           CONTINUE.                                                            

      ***************************************************************           
       2200-MOVER-CAMPOS-TABLA.                                                 
      ***************************************************************           

           IF  X372N005-SINTEGRO = 'N'                                          

               COMPUTE X372M001-IMPRTOINTEGRCAP-E  =                            
                       WS-RTO-INT-CAPITAL * (-1)                                

           ELSE                                                                 
               COMPUTE X372M001-IMPRTOINTEGRCAP-E  =                            
                       WS-RTO-INT-CAPITAL                                       

           END-IF                                                               

           IF  X372N005-SRETENI24 = 'N'                                         

               COMPUTE X372M001-IMPREDPRICAP-E =                                
                       WS-REDUCC-PRIMAS * (-1)                                  

           ELSE                                                                 
               COMPUTE X372M001-IMPREDPRICAP-E =                                
                       WS-REDUCC-PRIMAS                                         

           END-IF                                                               

           IF  X372N005-SRETRENTAN = 'N'                                        

               COMPUTE X372M001-IMPREDTRANCAP-E =                               
                       WS-REDUCC-TRANCAP * (-1)                                 

           ELSE                                                                 
               COMPUTE X372M001-IMPREDTRANCAP-E =                               
                       WS-REDUCC-TRANCAP                                        

           END-IF                                                               

           COMPUTE WS-RENDIMIENTO-NETO = X372M001-IMPRTOINTEGRCAP-E +           
                                         X372M001-IMPREDPRICAP-E +              
                                         X372M001-IMPREDTRANCAP-E               
           MOVE  X372N005-PRETENCION TO WS-PRETENCION-AUX                       
           COMPUTE WS-PRETENCION-AUX = WS-PRETENCION-AUX / 10                   
           COMPUTE WS-RETENCION-CAPITAL =                                       
                   WS-RENDIMIENTO-NETO * WS-PRETENCION-AUX / 100                
      *    FUNCTION NUMVAL (X372N005-PRETENCION)                                

           COMPUTE WS-LIQUIDO = WS-CAPITAL(I) +                                 
                                WS-BENEFICIOS(I) -                              
                                WS-ANTICIPOS(I) -                               
                                WS-INTPENDIENTES(I) -                           
                                WS-RETENCION-CAPITAL                            

           MOVE WS-RENDIMIENTO-NETO   TO X372M001-IMPRTONETOCAP-E               
           MOVE WS-RETENCION-CAPITAL  TO X372M001-IMPRETCAP-E                   
           MOVE WS-LIQUIDO            TO X372M001-IMPLIQCAP-E                   
           COMPUTE X372M001-PORRETCAP-E = WS-PRETENCION-AUX                     
      *    FUNCTION NUMVAL (X372N005-PRETENCION)                                
      *    COMPUTE X372M001-PORRETCAP-E = X372M001-PORRETCAP-E                  
      * INDICAMOS QUE EL USUARIO QUE HA MODIFICADO EL EXPEDIENTE ES             
      * UN FICHERO                                                              
           MOVE 'CFICHERO'            TO X372M001-CUSUARIO-E                    

           CONTINUE.                                                            



      ******************************************************************        
        8888-ROLLBACK.                                                          
      ******************************************************************        

           INITIALIZE WS-X001M001                                               
           MOVE 'R'   TO X001M001-CACCION                                       

           CALL WS-B001M001 USING WS-X001M001.                                  

      *****************************************************************         
        8889-COMMIT.                                                            
      *****************************************************************         
           INITIALIZE WS-X001M001                                               
           MOVE 'C' TO X001M001-CACCION                                         

           CALL WS-B001M001 USING WS-X001M001.                                  

      ***************************************************************           
       10000-FIN.                                                               
      ***************************************************************           

           IF SI-ROLLBACK                                                       
              PERFORM 8888-ROLLBACK                                             
           ELSE                                                                 
              PERFORM 8889-COMMIT                                               
           END-IF                                                               

           GOBACK.                                                              